## Architecture Decisions (Locked)

These are finalized. Do not re-ask or change without explicit user approval.

| Decision | Choice |
|---|---|
| State management | BLoC (`flutter_bloc` + `bloc`) |
| Navigation | GoRouter (`go_router`) |
