| Serialization | `freezed` + `json_serializable` |
| Linting | `very_good_analysis` |
| Platforms | Android + iOS only |
| Backend | REST API at `autohub.express` |
| Environment | `flutter_dotenv` (`.env` file, bundled as asset) |
| Error handling | `Either<Failure, Success>` pattern (`fpdart`) |
